[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13561.11, "timestamp": "03:46:01", "text": "一个陌生人。 他们会说：“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13564.79, "timestamp": "03:46:04", "text": "这里怎么有个男孩？那是什么？那条狗在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13567.59, "timestamp": "03:46:07", "text": "拉屎？搞什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13569.51, "timestamp": "03:46:09", "text": "搞什么鬼？那是屎。” 哦，狗狗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13572.309, "timestamp": "03:46:12", "text": "在拉屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13574.79, "timestamp": "03:46:14", "text": "那位女士正在抓粪便。 是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13576.55, "timestamp": "03:46:16", "text": "你不应该在大街上拉屎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13579.75, "timestamp": "03:46:19", "text": "。 呃，你得用塑料袋把宠物的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13583.83, "timestamp": "03:46:23", "text": "粪便捡起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13587.75, "timestamp": "03:46:27", "text": "这是你必须要做的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13589.99, "timestamp": "03:46:29", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13593.189, "timestamp": "03:46:33", "text": "呃，重要的是要谈谈和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13599.269, "timestamp": "03:46:39", "text": "我一起过夜这件事。 什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13609.269, "timestamp": "03:46:49", "text": "。 别搞砸了。 我猜也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13616.87, "timestamp": "03:46:56", "text": "等等，为什么它是绿色的？"}]